<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>EAST2 퍼포먼스 마케팅 주간 성과 리포트 - 0921주차</title>
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/Chart.js/4.4.0/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
<style>
:root{
--navy:#1f2937;
--navy-2:#111827;
--brand:#3454d1;
--brand-light:#eef1fd;
--good:#0e9f6e;
--good-bg:#e7f9f1;
--bad:#e02424;
--bad-bg:#fdecec;
--gray-50:#f9fafb;
--gray-100:#f3f4f6;
--gray-200:#e5e7eb;
--gray-400:#9ca3af;
--gray-500:#6b7280;
--gray-700:#374151;
--my:#f59e0b;
--sg:#3b82f6;
--radius:12px;
--shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(17,24,39,.08), 0 1px 2px rgba(17,24,39,.04);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;}
body{
margin:0;
font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Apple SD Gothic Neo","Malgun Gothic","Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
background:var(--gray-50);
color:var(--navy-2);
-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
}
.wrap{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px 80px;}
header.top{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1c2559,#3454d1);color:#fff;padding:28px 0 0;}
header.top .wrap{padding-bottom:0;}
.top-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;}
.top-row h1{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 6px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.2px;}
.top-row .sub{font-size:13px;opacity:.85;margin:0;}
.week-pill{background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);border-radius:999px;padding:8px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;}
.week-pill span{opacity:.75;font-weight:400;margin:0 4px;}
.kpi-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;margin:22px 0 -46px;}
.kpi-card{background:#fff;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:16px 18px;color:var(--navy-2);}
.kpi-card .label{font-size:12px;color:var(--gray-500);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;}
.kpi-card .value{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.3px;}
.kpi-card .delta{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;margin-top:6px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;}
.insight-box .headline{font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--navy-2);margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:-.2px;}
.data-note{font-size:11px;opacity:.8;margin-top:6px;text-align:right;}
.kpi-card .caption{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--gray-400);margin-top:6px;line-height:1.4;}
.kpi-card .sub{margin-top:10px;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px dashed var(--gray-200,#e5e7eb);}
.kpi-card .sub .sub-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:6px;}
.kpi-card .sub .sub-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--gray-500);font-weight:600;}
.kpi-card .sub .sub-value{font-size:15px;font-weight:800;}
.kpi-card .sub .sub-detail{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--gray-400);margin-top:3px;line-height:1.4;}
.delta.up{color:var(--good);background:var(--good-bg);}
.delta.down{color:var(--bad);background:var(--bad-bg);}
.delta.flat{color:var(--gray-500);background:var(--gray-100);}
main{padding-top:64px;}
nav.tabs{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--gray-200);box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.02);}
nav.tabs .wrap{display:flex;gap:4px;padding:0 20px;overflow-x:auto;}
nav.tabs button{border:none;background:none;cursor:pointer;padding:14px 16px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--gray-500);border-bottom:2.5px solid transparent;white-space:nowrap;}
nav.tabs button.active{color:var(--brand);border-color:var(--brand);}
nav.tabs button:hover{color:var(--brand);}
section.tabpanel{display:none;padding-top:26px;}
section.tabpanel.active{display:block;}
h2.sec-title{font-size:16px;margin:0 0 4px;font-weight:800;color:var(--navy-2);}
p.sec-desc{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--gray-500);margin:0 0 16px;}
.card{background:#fff;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:18px;}
.insight-box{background:var(--brand-light);border:1px solid #dbe2fb;border-radius:var(--radius);padding:16px 20px;margin-bottom:20px;}
.insight-box h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;color:var(--brand);font-weight:800;}
.insight-box ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--navy-2);}
.insight-box b{color:var(--brand);}

/* insight & next-to-do notes */
.note-legend{background:#fdecec;border:1px solid #f3b4b4;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:18px;font-size:12px;color:#7a1f1f;line-height:1.8;}
.note-legend b{color:#c81e1e;}
.note-card{border:1px solid var(--gray-200);border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;}
.note-card .note-title{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:800;color:var(--navy-2);margin-bottom:12px;}
.note-block{margin-bottom:12px;}
.note-block:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}
.note-label{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--gray-500);margin-bottom:5px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;}
.note-fact{font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--navy-2);margin:0;padding-left:18px;}
.note-fact li{margin-bottom:3px;}
.draft-tag{display:inline-block;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;background:#c81e1e;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:5px;letter-spacing:.2px;}
.draft-box{background:#fdecec;border:1px dashed #f3b4b4;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;}
.draft-box p{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#c81e1e;font-weight:700;}
.draft-box ol{margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.75;color:#c81e1e;font-weight:700;}
.draft-box li{margin-bottom:3px;}
.rule-note{background:#fff9e6;border:1px solid #f4e2a1;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:12px;color:#7c5b00;line-height:1.8;}
.rule-note b{color:#8a5a00;}
.note-box{background:#f3f4f6;border:1px solid var(--gray-200);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:12px;color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.8;}
.grid-media{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:12px;}
.country-block{margin-bottom:18px;}
.country-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px;}
.flag-dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;}
.flag-dot.my{background:var(--my);}
.flag-dot.sg{background:var(--sg);}
.country-head b{font-size:13.5px;}
.country-head span{font-size:12px;color:var(--gray-500);}
.ch-card{border:1px solid var(--gray-200);border-radius:10px;padding:13px 14px;}
.ch-card .ch-name{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy-2);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px;}
.ch-card .ch-total{font-size:11px;color:var(--gray-500);margin-bottom:10px;}
.obj-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px dashed var(--gray-200);}
.obj-row:first-of-type{border-top:none;}
.obj-row .obj-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--gray-500);font-weight:600;}
.obj-row .obj-metric{font-size:16px;font-weight:800;}
.obj-row .obj-sub{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--gray-500);}
.tag{font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:5px;}
.tag.roas{background:#eef1fd;color:var(--brand);}
.tag.cpc{background:#fff4e5;color:#b45309;}
.chart-wrap{position:relative;height:300px;}
.chart-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;gap:16px;}
.chart-grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;}
.promo-tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:14px;}
.promo-tag{font-size:11.5px;background:var(--gray-100);border:1px solid var(--gray-200);padding:5px 10px;border-radius:999px;color:var(--gray-700);}
.promo-tag b{color:var(--brand);}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12.5px;}
thead th{background:var(--navy-2);color:#fff;text-align:right;padding:9px 10px;font-weight:600;font-size:11.5px;position:sticky;top:0;}
thead th:first-child, thead th:nth-child(2){text-align:left;}
tbody td{padding:8px 10px;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid var(--gray-100);white-space:nowrap;}
tbody td:first-child, tbody td:nth-child(2){text-align:left;white-space:normal;}
tbody tr:hover{background:var(--gray-50);}
.table-scroll{overflow-x:auto;max-height:640px;overflow-y:auto;}
.num-up{color:var(--good);font-weight:700;}
.num-down{color:var(--bad);font-weight:700;}
.ctry-chip{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:5px;}
.ctry-chip.my{background:#fef3e2;color:#b45309;}
.ctry-chip.sg{background:#e8f0fe;color:#1d4ed8;}
.row-summary td{background:var(--brand-light);font-weight:700;color:var(--navy-2);border-bottom:1px solid #dbe2fb;}
.row-off td{background:var(--gray-100);color:var(--gray-400);}
.row-off td:first-child, .row-off td:nth-child(2){color:var(--gray-500);}
.row-new td{background:#fefbe8;}
.off-tag{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;color:var(--gray-400);background:var(--gray-200);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:5px;}
.new-tag{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;color:#a16207;background:#fef3c7;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:5px;}
.delta-best{background:rgba(34,197,94,0.2);padding:3px 9px;border-radius:6px;display:inline-block;}
.delta-worst{background:rgba(239,68,68,0.16);padding:3px 9px;border-radius:6px;display:inline-block;}
.grp-toggle-row td{background:#fff;padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--gray-100);}
.grp-toggle-btn{border:none;background:none;color:var(--brand);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:2px 0;}
.grp-toggle-btn .arrow{transition:transform .15s;font-size:10px;}
.grp-toggle-btn.open .arrow{transform:rotate(90deg);}
tr.grp-detail{display:none;}
tr.grp-detail.open{display:table-row;}
.subtabs{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px;}
.subtabs button{border:1px solid var(--gray-200);background:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 14px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--gray-500);cursor:pointer;}
.subtabs button.active{background:var(--brand);color:#fff;border-color:var(--brand);}
.gallery-filter{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.gallery-filter button{border:1px solid var(--gray-200);background:#fff;border-radius:999px;padding:6px 14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--gray-500);cursor:pointer;}
.gallery-filter button.active{background:var(--navy-2);color:#fff;border-color:var(--navy-2);}
.gallery-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;align-items:start;}
@media (min-width:901px){ .gallery-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));} }
.g-card{border:1px solid var(--gray-200);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;}
.g-thumb{height:150px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;position:relative;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c7d2fe,#818cf8);background-color:#eef0fb;}
.g-thumb.thumb-square{aspect-ratio:1/1;height:auto;}
.g-thumb.thumb-vertical{aspect-ratio:9/16;height:auto;}
.g-thumb.thumb-capture{aspect-ratio:3/4;height:auto;background-color:#f3f4f6;background-image:none!important;}
.g-thumb.thumb-capture .capture-img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block;background:#f3f4f6;}
.g-thumb.video::after{content:"▶";position:absolute;font-size:26px;color:#fff;opacity:.9;}
.g-thumb small{position:absolute;bottom:8px;left:8px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.35);padding:2px 7px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;}
.g-rank{position:absolute;top:8px;left:8px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);}
.g-rank.best{color:var(--good);}
.g-rank.worst{color:var(--bad);}
.g-body{padding:12px 13px;}
.g-body .g-title{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.4;word-break:break-all;}
.g-body .g-meta{font-size:11px;color:var(--gray-500);display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.g-body .g-metric{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:800;color:var(--brand);line-height:1.5;}
.g-body .g-criteria{font-size:10px;color:var(--gray-400);line-height:1.5;margin-top:6px;border-top:1px dashed var(--gray-200);padding-top:6px;}
.g-preview-btn{display:block;text-align:center;margin-top:9px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;background:var(--brand);padding:6px 0;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;transition:opacity .15s;}
.g-preview-btn:hover{opacity:.85;}
.acc{border:1px solid var(--gray-200);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:10px;overflow:hidden;}
.acc-head{background:var(--gray-50);padding:12px 16px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;}
.acc-head .arrow{transition:transform .15s;color:var(--gray-500);}
.acc.open .acc-head .arrow{transform:rotate(90deg);}
.acc-body{display:none;padding:14px 16px;}
.acc.open .acc-body{display:block;}
.legend-note{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--gray-500);margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.legend-note span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;}
.dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;}
.dot.good{background:var(--good);} .dot.bad{background:var(--bad);}
footer{text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--gray-400);padding:30px 0 10px;}
@media (max-width:900px){
.kpi-row{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
.grid-media{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
.chart-grid, .chart-grid-2{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
.gallery-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="top">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="top-row">
<div>
<h1 id="reportTitle">EAST2 퍼포먼스 마케팅 주간 성과 리포트</h1>
<p class="sub">국가(말레이시아·싱가포르) x 매체(Meta·TikTok·Shopee Ads·Google) 성과 비교 · 전주 대비 금주</p>
</div>
<div class="week-pill">금주 09/21 – 09/27 <span>vs</span> 전주 09/14 – 09/20</div>
</div>
<div class="data-note" id="dataNote"></div>
<div class="kpi-row" id="kpiRow"></div>
</div>
</header>

<main>
<nav class="tabs">
<div class="wrap">
<button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="overview">개요</button>
<button class="tab-btn" data-tab="trend">트렌드</button>
<button class="tab-btn" data-tab="campaign">캠페인 상세</button>
<button class="tab-btn" data-tab="gallery">Best·Worst 소재</button>
<button class="tab-btn" data-tab="insight">인사이트 & Next To-Do</button>
<button class="tab-btn" data-tab="detail">국가별 상세 데이터</button>
</div>
</nav>

<div class="wrap">

<section class="tabpanel active" id="tab-overview">
<div class="insight-box">
<h3>이번 주 핵심 요약</h3>
<p class="headline" id="insightHeadline"></p>
<ul id="insightList"></ul>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2 class="sec-title">국가 x 매체 성과 비교</h2>
<p class="sec-desc">매체 카드는 전체(전환+트래픽) 지출·매출 기준으로 묶어서 보여주고, 목적이 섞여 있는 매체는 카드 안에서 전환/트래픽 지표를 각각 병기합니다.</p>
<div class="rule-note">
<b>캠페인 목적 판별 기준</b> — Meta: 캠페인 타입 <b>BR = 트래픽</b>, 그 외(OG/PR/TEST) = 전환 · TikTok: 매체명 <b>Tiktok = 트래픽</b>, <b>TiktokGMV = 전환</b> (Meta·TikTok 모두 카드 하나에 전환/트래픽 두 줄로 병기) · Shopee Ads·Google: 전환 100% · 싱가포르는 TikTok 미운영으로 매체 3개
</div>
<div id="countryChannelGrid"></div>
<div class="legend-note">
<span><span class="dot good"></span> 전주 대비 개선 (ROAS·매출 ↑ / CPC·CPA ↓)</span>
<span><span class="dot bad"></span> 전주 대비 악화 (ROAS·매출 ↓ / CPC·CPA ↑)</span>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="tabpanel" id="tab-trend">
<div class="card">
<h2 class="sec-title">일별 지출·매출·ROAS 트렌드</h2>
<p class="sec-desc">막대: 지출/매출(좌측 축) · 선: ROAS(우측 축, %) · 전 매체·전 국가 합산 기준</p>
<div class="chart-wrap" style="height:380px;"><canvas id="trendChart"></canvas></div>
<div class="promo-tags" id="promoTags"></div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2 class="sec-title">매체별 전주 대비 금주 비교</h2>
<p class="sec-desc">전환 목적 매체는 ROAS, 트래픽 목적 매체는 CPC로 비교합니다 (MY+SG 합산). Meta·TikTok은 전환분과 트래픽분을 분리해서 집계했습니다.</p>
<div class="chart-grid-2">
<div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="convRoasChart"></canvas></div>
<div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="trafficCpcChart"></canvas></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="tabpanel" id="tab-campaign">
<div class="card">
<h2 class="sec-title">캠페인 목적별 성과 (전체 캠페인)</h2>
<p class="sec-desc">동일 매체라도 캠페인 목적에 따라 우선 지표가 다릅니다 — 전환 캠페인은 ROAS, 트래픽 캠페인(Meta BR / TikTok)은 CPC 기준으로 정렬됩니다. 지출 큰 순.</p>
<div class="subtabs">
<button class="sub-btn active" data-sub="conv">전환 캠페인 (ROAS 우선) · <span id="convCount"></span>개</button>
<button class="sub-btn" data-sub="traffic">트래픽 캠페인 (CPC 우선) · <span id="trafficCount"></span>개</button>
</div>
<div id="convSection">
<p class="sec-desc" style="margin-bottom:10px;">기본적으로 국가x매체별 요약만 표시됩니다. 각 요약 아래 "상세 캠페인별 증감률 보기"를 누르면 개별 캠페인이 펼쳐집니다.</p>
<div class="table-scroll" id="convTableWrap"></div>
</div>
<div class="table-scroll" id="trafficTableWrap" style="display:none;"></div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="tabpanel" id="tab-gallery">
<div class="card">
<h2 class="sec-title">Best · Worst 소재</h2>
<p class="sec-desc">전환 소재: 캠페인 내 지출 중위값 이상 + 구매 1건 이상 소재 중 ROAS 최고/최저 · 트래픽 소재: 캠페인 내 노출 상위 70% 소재 중 CPC 최저/최고. 각 카드 하단에 선정 기준을 함께 표기했습니다.</p>
<div class="gallery-filter" id="galleryFilter"></div>
<div class="gallery-grid" id="galleryGrid"></div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="tabpanel" id="tab-insight">
<div class="card">
